<title>USA: Hudson names Michael Hudson president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Hudson names Michael Hudson president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ROGERS, Ark. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson Foods Inc Monday said it named Michael Hudson president and chief executive, replacing his father, James Hudson.</p>
<p>James Hudson will remain as working chairman of the board of the poultry company.</p>
<p>Michael Hudson was formally president and chief operating officer, the company said.</p>
